# House .gitignore for an app repo. Decisions: jon-platform docs/ios/drift-control.md § The .gitignore.
# Copy it to the app's root, replace YesChef with the XcodeGen project name, list the generated
# plists and entitlements, and put anything else in the last section.

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Xcode per-user state
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate

# Build output. /build/ holds whatever jon-platform scripts write, such as testflight's archives,
# exports and notes in build/testflight/.
.build/
.swiftpm/
DerivedData/
/build/

# Generated from project.yml by XcodeGen. Only the project-level Swift package pins are tracked.
# A local package's own Package.resolved (for example YesChefLibrary/Package.resolved) stays tracked.
YesChef.xcodeproj/*
!YesChef.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/
YesChef.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/*
!YesChef.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/
YesChef.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/*
!YesChef.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/
YesChef.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/*
!YesChef.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved

# Also generated: every Info.plist and .entitlements whose contents project.yml declares under
# `properties:`. List each one here, for example:
# YesChef/Info.plist
# YesChef/YesChef.entitlements

# Machine-local build credentials. The tracked Config/Secrets.example.xcconfig shows the keys.
Config/Secrets.xcconfig

# Machine-local Claude Code state. The shared .claude/settings.json and skills stay tracked.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/jon-platform
.claude/worktrees/

# Agent scratch: throwaway probe scripts and output, never committed.
/scratch/

# App-specific
# Nothing under .claude/ is tracked here, so ignore all of it.
.claude/
import-inbox/
